      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Yarraville (VIC 3013)**, here are several well-reviewed options:\n\n- Omega Security Solutions (Yarraville) – Local locksmith offering digital and keyless lock installation during business hours.\n- Lock, Smith and Barrel (West Footscray) – 24/7 emergency locksmith with strong customer reviews and experience installing smart locks.\n- Precision Locksmiths Melbourne (Spotswood) – 24/7 locksmith with extensive experience in residential smart lock installations.\n- Onpoint Locksmith (Footscray) – Local locksmith servicing Melbourne's inner west, including smart lock fitting.\n- SMART LOCK INSTALLATION – Specialist installer focused on digital and smart locks.\n\nFor a standard installation where you're replacing an existing deadbolt, recent jobs around Yarraville have commonly been priced at around **A$120–A$200** for labour only. If your door needs new holes drilled, modifications to the mortise, or additional carpentry, the cost may be higher. [www.airtasker.com](https://www.airtasker.com/au/services/lock-installation/yarraville-vic/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you haven't bought the lock yet, I can also recommend models based on your needs, such as:\n- Apple Home Key\n- Google Home / Android\n- Fingerprint access\n- PIN code only\n- Rental / Airbnb use\n- Budget under a specific amount\n\nJust let me know your door type (timber, aluminium, or security door) and your budget.",
